    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>5级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 62；''重伤'' 31</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 19，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 18，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（冲锋时为 8）</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">先下手为强</div>\n<div class=description>半兽人猎人的近战攻击对任何在该遭遇中未受到伤害的生物造成 1d10 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}战斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d10+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}长弓（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 20/40，+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d10+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}闪跃砍（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：该半兽人猎人在该攻击前和攻击后快步 1 格：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d10+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">狂怒进攻✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当该半兽人猎人伤害一个敌人时。<br>该半兽人猎人的攻击造成 1d10 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（半兽人）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 坚韧+9，自然+8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+5）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+5）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+2）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，巨人语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，战斧，长弓，20 支箭</span></div></div>\n</div>",
